					</li>
					<li>
						<foundation Class="IdeoFoundation_Deity">
							<def>Deity</def>
							<place>Lutuni</place>
							<deities />
						</foundation>
						<name>the Contract</name>
						<adjective>ideological</adjective>
						<memberName>Ideologist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Ethical Dog</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Ethical Dog</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>A contract is the only honest thing two strangers can hold between them. It names one person, one price, one ending, and everyone not written into it walks away untouched. We do not pillage — pillage is confessing you could not find the one you came for. Take the mark or refuse it in the open. Once it is taken it is finished, or you are.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>"My family, my clan, my team - they all tried to keep a shroud over my eyes to stop me from seeing a simple fact: Only a life lived with honour, courage and skill is worth living. Perhaps if you atone for our crimes you can truly understand this fact."

  - &lt;i&gt;Life of a Honourable Shuttle Pilot&lt;/i&gt; by Nick 'Smokey' Grey</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Kriminul</culture>
						<iconDef>sw_CzerkaCorporation</iconDef>
						<colorDef>DarkPurple</colorDef>
						<primaryFactionColor>RGBA(0.810, 0.102, 0.347, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
						<memes>
							<li>Structure_Ideological</li>
							<li>Guilty</li>
							<li>Individualist</li>
							<li>VME_Bushido</li>
							<li>VME_Anonymity</li>
						</memes>
